      "chunk_text": "Dhruv asked if there is a waiting period before the new policy becomes effective. Vikram explained there is a 30\u2011day waiting period but coverage will be backdated to the sign\u2011up date, so Dhruv can proceed now and will receive the new policy document by email and in his online account. Dhruv also asked whether his old policy still appears as expired.",
